  "summary": { "en": [ "1 playground in Mundell Park (Wesbrook Village, UBC), next to an open lawn. Not in the City of Vancouver open data; the position is where the survey photos were taken. The play structure was crowded on the survey day, so only part of the equipment has been recorded; to be photographed again." ], "ja": [ "Mundell Park（UBC の Wesbrook Village）にある遊び場 1 か所。芝生の広場の隣にある。市のオープンデータには無く、位置は現地調査の写真を撮った地点。調査の日は複合遊具に人が多く、遊具は一部しか記録できていない。撮り直す予定。" ] },
